  "card": "This pull request replaces the O(N log N) sort in CTxMemPool::GetSortedScoreWithTopology() with an O(N) traversal over TxGraph's chunk index. Currently, retrieving the topological and fee-rate order of the mempool requires sorting all transactions while holding the cs lock, which delays concurrent operations during getrawmempool queries, P2P mempool message handling, and mempool persistence. The author reports reducing getrawmempool execution time on 60k transactions from 99 ms to 24 ms, significantly reducing mempool lock contention for indexers.",
